      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KRAKEN WESTERN (6) is a progressive type who recorded his 4th career win last time out (22.34) at Shepparton. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. PAW RAZOR (3) turned in a better effort at Sandown last start, finishing third behind Say My Grace (30.29) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to his credit. Expected to feature. ZAMBADA ICON (2) finds it hard to break through. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing second (24.12) at this track. Solid record here winning four races. Expected to be in the finish again. KENSINGTON FLYER (1) will give backers a sight.",
